Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understand, Kobato!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Summer vacation is our rival! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Summer vacation is all about going to the sea, catching bugs, splitting watermelons! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's full of ways to draw people's attention away from the scars and pain within their hearts! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dobato, are you even listening!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A letter... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not a letter, that's a flyer! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you you wouldn't get anywhere with collecting candy like this! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even more importantly, summer festivals are a serious foe. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Flutes and taiko, festivals and yukata, the list just goes on and on. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you even understand what I'm saying!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done talking yet! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't lose to summer vacation! I'll heal everyone's scarred hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{op} 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A summer festival... 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did it fly off to? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Use this. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your hands are all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's she up to? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a flyer for the summer festival! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, it's about time for that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever gone? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every year since I was a little girl. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The portable shrine, the festival, the fireworks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fireworks...? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not going this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's race when we get to the pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! I won't lose! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah? I learned to swim! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to get going. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have classes today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery has the summer off! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Nacchan! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were looking at your phone rather than where you were walking again, huh. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up, you'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been telling you, we can't let summer vacation beat us! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold still! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna get you fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dry me out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm, that uniform's from Seinan Girls' Academy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know Nacchan, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a high school attached to a womens' college. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka and Chitose graduated from there. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a school for young ladies. It's completely out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's being mean again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he busy with work and studying while the nursery's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to go give this back? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan isn't here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up, it's gonna get dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:56.45,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,At the beginning of the second semester,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:06:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:06:02.19,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Mizuhashi Natsuki accepted a commendation from the prefectural govenment for green-up efforts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:06.74,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,on behalf of the Volunteer Club. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So Nacchan is named Mizuhashi Natsuki. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she's in the same class as the airhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:20.65,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't stay up late just because it's vacation! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's the girl from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.81,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,It's easy to slack off during summer vacation. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.07,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Students of Seinan should show proper moderation... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You again, Morikawa? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't cool it, I'm taking that thing! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.95,0:06:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So-Sorry... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:40.15,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, let's go over our emergency contacts for summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's a great shot! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a good sense for it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have some self-confidence. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.83,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,That is all. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:55.51,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Would those responsible for pool cleaning please gather at poolside. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a student here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm Hanato Kobato from Yomogi Nursery. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery? What are you talking about!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You over there! Hurry up and get someone from the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This sucks. Run away, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll try! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hold it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I've got to find Natsuki. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it by the lens. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The real thing is great! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to buy one soon, Yukinocchi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the girl that was with Nacchan this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:08:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Yukino, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the girl from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm returning your handkerchief! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You washed it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! But I don't have an iron, so it's all wrinkled. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about that. Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'm out of here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the pool cleaning? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I didn't tell you, but I have work...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that against the school rules? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but... 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Nacchan. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's trying her hardest to buy a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're helping with the pool, so you can go ahead today! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.95,0:09:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come along with you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like Fujimoto said. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is out of my league.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just saying "I'll come along with you!" out of nowhere is a pretty lame pickup line. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pickup? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's lame? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to try and pick you up! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:10:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want to go home alone either, so it cheered me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This photo... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like Yukino. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's from a summer festival when we were in grade school. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look so happy together! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy together, huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you get along now? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she's been avoiding me... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,'Morning, Nacchan. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Yukino. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your shirt's untucked in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We always used to walk to school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your bed head's horrible, Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But then it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Nacchan, I overslept! Go ahead without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It got worse when we started high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Nacchan, you can go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, if you're in to photography, you should join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure I'm that into it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, just come and watch one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, we've been completely seperated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.03,0:11:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean "I don't understand"!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm going to try talking with Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That should be enough for the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take whichever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, don't worry, I'm already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've finally got the money together. Tomorrow I'll be able to go to the mall by the train station and buy a camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Different from the one you had yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a friend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want my own so badly. That's why I got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing, Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got interested using my phone's camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but now I'm really into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love my new friends in the photography club, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We talk so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about Natsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you talk with Natsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They match!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go buy straps!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Matching ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno about matching even that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki, so watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, so a snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we swap?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you get along with her any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you hate her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, there's no way I'd hate her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I look up to her so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man, that's embarassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take one together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me take the next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get better at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki and Yukino both want to get along better, so why can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno. If they can't figure it out, why do you think you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I want to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, which camera shop is having the sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try it out when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You went shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A single-lens reflex camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You worked hard and got a good camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we're jealous even though we're in the photography club!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukinocchi, you should join!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it'd be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To remember your SLR debut...{*}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You finally bought the camera you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! You should come to the next shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're talented, I'm sure you'll take great photos!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's lots of people who mistakenly think just composing a shot like you see in ads makes you a good photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you one of them, Yukino?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amateurs who act all pro even though they don't have any talent are the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'd like to have talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but for now I just enjoy taking pictures and like cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you bought the camera you wanted. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you leave me alone for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I say that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone! The strap is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't like Natsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.41,0:18:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to tell her something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, we can't just leave her like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone! The strap is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I looked there over and over. It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was so mean to Yukino...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'll help look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:19:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do... I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.65,0:19:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you two really can still get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I was afraid of Yukino...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of how wonderfully serious she was?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino had changed a bit from back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and now and then it felt like she was getting distant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was really worried that she was brushing me aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I didn't know what to do except focus on studying and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I pushed her away first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki, can I borrow your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\pos(452,254)\c&H717B85&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H637983&\pos(452,254)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan still has it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, I said such horrible things...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.41,0:21:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:22:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, Chihiro, have you two ever fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.31,0:22:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even remember how many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes we wouldn't even speak afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that definitely happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you still get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nacchan, smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's embarassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.16,0:22:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,90 points for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.16,0:22:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take that, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing getting healed by the summer festival!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it. Minus 200 points, Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't the fireworks so pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, listen to people when they talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:22:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:19.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:27.39,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:37.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:42.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:50.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:56.42,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:01.64,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:07.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:13.61,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:20.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:29.04,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(424,166)}... Summer memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:08.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:15.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:23.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:32.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:43.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:45.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:54.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:24:01.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:11.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:15.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:28.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... An organ, and boyhood days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:23:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
